## UPilot-20260923-BridgeLargeResultFrame - WebSocket result larger than default frame limit

- Observed impact: A complete Test Runner result exceeded the WebSocket 1 MiB default, interrupting observation of original `test.results` identity and acceptance reporting. Affected path: `upilotserver~/src/upilot_mcp/server.py` Bridge connection.
- Improvement/evidence: The source now sets a 4 MiB Bridge frame ceiling; `tests/test_socket_shutdown.py` exercises a 1,316,191-byte result frame and passed in the targeted Python selection. Follow up with a real large-result observation against attested loaded Server code; return a bounded, explicit diagnostic if results grow beyond 4 MiB, never replay a business command in response. Status: source fix and targeted regression passed; loaded-source identity unverified.
